1. 飲茶 - 廣東話：我尋日同朋友去飲茶，叫咗好多點心。
English: I went to yum cha with my friends yesterday and ordered a lot of dim sum.

2. 圖書館 - 廣東話：你屋企附近有冇圖書館？
English: Is there a library near your home?

3. 養聲 - 廣東話：保養聲線、聲帶，令到唔會過份勞損，或者勞損之後康復。
English: To keep your voice and ear healthy, avoid excessive strain, and recover after any injury.

4. 票尾 - 廣東話：喺張#飛 度搣落嚟留返畀持有者做#收據 嘅嗰部份。
English: You can leave your ID at the front desk for the person holding it to use as identification.

5. hacker - 廣東話：打#高爾夫球。
English: Hacker is a person who uses computers to perform various tasks.

6. 石斛蘭 - 廣東話：植物名；一種蘭花，特點係會依附喺樹上面生長。
English: Stone aloes are a type of plant whose flowers are attached to the tree.

7. 吊詭 - 廣東話：似非而是、荒謬。
English: It can mean either something is not true or it is very strange.

8. 吊詭 - 廣東話：似非而是、荒謬。
English: It can also mean something is not true or it is very strange.

9. 各為其主 - 廣東話：各自為咗主子、上級佢哋嘅利益，嘅佢哋指示下，未免同對方為敵。
English: Each person acts independently to serve their own interests and may appear to be against the other party.

10. 軨蓋 - 廣東話：即係#呔軨。
English: It means the roof, which is the part of the roof that is used for the purpose of catching the wind.

11. 打哥夫 - 廣東話：打#高爾夫球。
English: A hiker is a person who plays highball.

12. 免揀 - 廣東話：指所售賣嘅貨品唔畀人揀。
English: To avoid being cheated, you should not take items that you do not want.

13. 擺闊佬 - 廣東話：展現闊氣，擺出財力雄厚嘅姿態。
English: A broadcaster displays a broad and generous image of their business.

14. 廣播劇 - 廣東話：喺收音機定時播放嘅連續劇。
English: A TV show is a continuous series that is broadcast on a radio station at regular intervals.

15. 錄影機 - 廣東話：#錄影 嘅機器（部）。
English: A camera is a device used for recording images.

16. 吟詩吟唔甩 - 廣東話：表示證據確鑿，無法抵賴。
English: To sing a poem, you must be able to prove it, as it cannot be disproved.

17. 佈道大會 - 廣東話：宗教嘅傳道大會。
English: A religious preaching meeting is a gathering of believers to discuss and preach.

18. 寫手 - 廣東話：#寫作 嘅人。
English: A writer is a person who writes.

19. 寫手 - 廣東話：代替他人寫作嘅人。
English: A writer can also be a substitute for someone else.

20. 代打 - 廣東話：#代替 另一人#打機。
English: A jobber is a person who takes over another person's work.

21. 茶碗 - 廣東話：用嚟飲茶嘅碗，通常會理解為由陶瓷燒製而成嘅日本茶道道具。
English: A tea bowl is a ceramic dish used for drinking tea.

22. 茶隔 - 廣東話：將茶葉同茶湯分開嘅道具，大概有兩種用法，一種係可以裝住茶葉，放入沖泡器具入面，到茶湯沖好嘅時候就可以拎起嘅；而另一種就係就咁一個篩或者網，俾人擺喺茶杯或者茶壺上面，喺斟茶嘅時候先將茶葉同茶湯分離。
English: A tea filter is a device used to separate tea leaves from tea water.

23. 只許州官放火，不准百姓點燈 - 廣東話：比喻權貴階層可以為所欲為，老百姓嘅正當言行就受到種種限制；又或一個人言行雙重標準。源於宋朝一個州長叫田登，要求百姓避諱唔准用「登」字同音嘅字，於是大家就將「燈」改稱為「火」。到咗元宵節嘅時候，政府貼出告示：「本州依例放火三日」。
English: This is a metaphor where the wealthy can do anything for themselves, while ordinary people are restricted in their actions. It originated from a Qing dynasty governor named Tian Deng who required citizens to avoid using the word "tian" in his name. By the time of the Lantern Festival, the government issued a notice: "This province will light fires for three days."

24. 獨唱 - 廣東話：一個人唱，唔係同人一齊唱。
English: A soloist is a person who performs alone.

25. 快人快事 - 廣東話：爽快人做嘢爽快。
English: A fast person makes quick and efficient work.

26. 四腳獸 - 廣東話：指兩個人喺公廁入面親熱甚至做愛。喺廁所外面門縫望落去，會見到四隻腳，因此稱為四腳獸。
English: A four-legged creature refers to two people who are friendly and even affectionate in the privacy of the house, and they are seen as four legs.

27. 無米粥 - 廣東話：初步嘅洽談。因為事情所涉嘅重要條件同細節都未有著落，所以為謹慎計，只是話「煲無米粥」，以免他人期望過高。
English: A no-milk porridge is a preliminary negotiation because the important conditions and details of the matter are not yet established, so it is prudent to avoid setting high expectations.

28. 義會 - 廣東話：舊時低下階層嘅借貸或者集資活動。因為佢地冇抵押或者擔保，難以向銀行借錢，於是就集合朋友、鄰居、同業等，將大家嘅錢定期集合起嚟供會，邊個急需用錢，就可以畀利息#標會，拎咗筆錢，然後分期本息還返畀其他人。
English: A traditional loan or investment activity was once associated with lower-class people. Since they lacked collateral or insurance, they could not borrow money from banks. Therefore, they would gather friends, neighbors, and colleagues to collect their money regularly for the purpose of meeting, which could then be lent out with interest, and then repaid in installments to others.

29. 榜文 - 廣東話：貼喺#榜 上面嘅文字。
English: A poster is a piece of text that is posted on a board.

30. MK名 - 廣東話：係指#MK 喺網上會用嘅名，配有意味不明嘅特殊符號，或者配上特定字頭嘅名。特定字頭包括：堅系、醉愛、絕對、唯愛、跳制、謝絕等。
English: A MK name refers to a name used on the internet, which may have a mysterious symbol or include specific character marks. The character marks include: firm, love, absolute, love, jump, and absolute.

I hope this helps! If you have any more questions or need further assistance, feel free to ask. [end of text]


